From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kreijstal <elektrischrainbow@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 20:01:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 14/18] WebView2 helpers: build without MSVC's <wrl/event.h>

Use wxWidgets' own Callback() replacement and declare the WebView2
interface UUIDs, as wx's Edge backend does for MinGW. Drop the unused
ATL include and two unused private wx headers.
---
 src/slic3r/GUI/ExtraRenderers.cpp            |  2 --
 src/slic3r/GUI/WebViewPlatformUtilsWin32.cpp | 30 ++++++++++++++------
 2 files changed, 21 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/slic3r/GUI/ExtraRenderers.cpp b/src/slic3r/GUI/ExtraRenderers.cpp
index c544875..c73e260 100644
--- a/src/slic3r/GUI/ExtraRenderers.cpp
+++ b/src/slic3r/GUI/ExtraRenderers.cpp
@@ -13,8 +13,6 @@
 #include <wx/dc.h>
